title: "Replication Package for Weighting Geometry in Aggregate-Instrument Causal Analysis of Renewable Energy Policy and Emissions"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-25
authors:
  - family-names: "Dadjouy"
    given-names: "Saleh"
    affiliation: "University of Northern Colorado"
    email: "saleh.dadjouy@unco.edu"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SalehDadjouy/energy-policy-emissions-code"
url: "https://github.com/SalehDadjouy/energy-policy-emissions-code"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research materials for a state-panel aggregate instrumental-variable study
  of renewable energy policy and electric-power emissions. The repository
  contains the analysis-ready panel, empirical TSLS and Robust analyses,
  exposure-correlated aggregate-shock simulations, reported sensitivity
  analyses, reference results, and a workflow that reproduces the reported
  analysis from the included inputs.
keywords:
  - aggregate instruments
  - causal inference
  - robust aggregate-instrument estimation
  - renewable energy policy
  - electric-power emissions
  - reproducibility
